  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.3522 provides an overview of end-to-end (E2E) cloud service lifecycle management by specifying cloud service lifecycle metadata, the cloud service lifecycle management framework, cloud service lifecycle management stages and the relationship with cloud computing reference architecture. This Recommendation also provides E2E cloud service lifecycle management functional requirements derived from the corresponding typical use cases.</abstract>
